Package: scx-scheds
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: sched_ext schedulers and tools
 Process schedulers that run as BPF programs through the kernel's sched_ext
 class (scx_lavd, scx_bpfland, scx_rusty, scx_cosmos, scx_flash, scx_p2dq and
 the others of the sched-ext/scx project). The service is installed and stays
 off until it is enabled; a kernel with CONFIG_SCHED_CLASS_EXT and BTF is needed.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo"
 Pijanowski). Upstream: Tejun Heo, David Vernet, Andrea Righi, Changwoo Min
 and the sched-ext contributors.
